<item><title>Namibia delays national airline launch to June 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-delays-national-airline-launch-to-june-2027-f789ef/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-delays-national-airline-launch-to-june-2027-f789ef/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The Ministry of Works and Transport says aircraft delivery delays have moved the planned start of commercial flights from December 2026.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:45:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" length="33196" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Headspring gets approval for Stampriet uranium research boreholes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/headspring-gets-approval-for-stampriet-uranium-research-9accae/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/headspring-gets-approval-for-stampriet-uranium-research-9accae/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The company says it will use no chemical reagents in the research phase and plans to submit a revised pilot-testing application.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" length="33196" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Namibia&apos;s financial regulator pilots crowdfunding and peer-to-peer lending platforms</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-financial-regulator-pilots-crowdfunding-and-peer-14e5e0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-financial-regulator-pilots-crowdfunding-and-peer-14e5e0/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>Two firms will test digital funding services under supervisory limits as Namibia develops rules for financing models it does not yet regulate.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:43:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-financial-regulator-pilots-crowdfunding-and-peer-14e5e0/share.jpg" length="45792" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-financial-regulator-pilots-crowdfunding-and-peer-14e5e0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>FNB Namibia urges stronger digital safeguards as 72% of transactions go online</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/fnb-namibia-urges-stronger-digital-safeguards-as-72-of-3e971d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/fnb-namibia-urges-stronger-digital-safeguards-as-72-of-3e971d/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The bank says more than 92% of its customers are digitally enabled, and an industry writer warns that fraudsters are exploiting that convenience.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:21:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" length="33196" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Oceana reports 29% decline in Namibia horse mackerel catch</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/oceana-reports-29-decline-in-namibia-horse-mackerel-catch-52bdea/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/oceana-reports-29-decline-in-namibia-horse-mackerel-catch-52bdea/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The company attributed the drop mainly to extended vessel surveys and late-year quota shortages that reduced fishing time.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:19:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" length="33196" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
